# Context allowlist for the PYTHON-RUST layer Dockerfile (BuildKit reads the
# `<Dockerfile-name>.dockerignore` beside the Dockerfile). The build context is
# the REPO ROOT; this layer COPYs only the factory build-telemetry seam — the
# cargo-phase emitter and the `cargo` shim — so allowlisting just those two files
# keeps the context transfer tiny and the build hermetic.
*
!livespec_dev_tooling/otel_cargo_phase.py
!docker/fabro-sandbox/python-rust/cargo-phase-shim.sh
